      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The Tier 2 casing is titanium and holds up to 20 charges, four times the Tier 1 casing. Its blast types are made in the Assembler at EV, and every one takes eight titanium plates and a Fuze Assembly Mk II.\n\nThe Mk II fuze is an EV Assembler recipe from a Data circuit, a titanium plate and 4 fine electrum wires. A Fragmentation warhead, for example, adds 10 Industrial TNT, 4 Plastic Explosive and a titanium Fragmentation Sleeve. Check NEI for all of them. Make a Tier 2 warhead.\n\n[warn]Tier 2 blasts reach much farther than Tier 1. Read the tooltip\u0027s radius before you place one.[/warn]",
